#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:2
msgid "Deploying Morpheus with the HPE Installer (Recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:4
msgid ""
"The HPE Morpheus Manager Installer is a graphical wizard that deploys "
"Morpheus Enterprise or VM Essentials to an HPE HVM host in minutes. It "
"handles the entire deployment process including image upload, VM "
"creation, network configuration, and post-deployment verification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:6
msgid "The installer is available on the HVM ISO file in two versions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:8
msgid "**macOS**: ``Morpheus_Manager_Installer-x64-<version>.dmg``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:9
msgid "**Windows**: ``Morpheus_Manager_Installer-x64-<version>.zip``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:11
#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:283
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:11
msgid ""
"Deployment duration depends on image size, source method, network "
"throughput, host storage, and first-boot processing. Use the phase and "
"log output described below to judge progress rather than relying on a "
"fixed duration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:13
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/installation/singleNode/hpe_installer.rst:13
msgid ""
"A local QCOW2 deployment does not require internet access, but the "
"deployed Manager's Ubuntu base OS still requires an HPE-approved APT "
"source for ongoing updates. Before production use, plan either approved "
"repository access or an internal mirror. See :doc:`Morpheus Manager Base "
"OS Updates </getting_started/maintenance/manager_os_updates>`."
msgstr ""

